Map data:
  Natural Earth, public domain. See https://www.naturalearthdata.com/
  The default archive contains land, lakes, boundaries, rivers and populated
  places derived from the pinned Natural Earth release recorded in
  map-build/natural-earth/build_natural_earth.py.

Place index:
  Natural Earth 1:10m populated places, public domain.
  See https://www.naturalearthdata.com/

Optional OSM build path:
  The alternate archive built with Planetiler/OpenMapTiles contains
  © OpenStreetMap contributors, licensed under the Open Database License
  (ODbL) 1.0. See https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright and
  https://openmaptiles.org. It is not the default V1 build.

Glyph fonts:
  Noto Sans (Regular, Bold, Italic), licensed under the SIL Open Font License
  1.1. See public/fonts/LICENSE.

Splash font:
  Roboto Thin, Copyright 2011 The Roboto Project Authors, licensed under the
  SIL Open Font License 1.1. See public/fonts/roboto/OFL.txt.

Planetiler, MapLibre GL JS and PMTiles are separate open-source projects
distributed under their own licenses.
